SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0

Public Oblivious DoH (RFC 9230) relays and targets, their operators, people, jurisdictions, hosting networks,
bootstrap addresses and key configurations, and the default relay and target pairs, collected by the Datapavan
project from public lists, the operators' own pages, registry (RDAP) records and its own measurements, and
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Recorded in
ADR 0015 and ADR 0042. The sources are cited as evidence; nothing is copied from them.
